  "text": {
    "I couldn't read “{time}” as a time. Use HH:MM, 9am, noon, or YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM.": "无法把“{time}”识别为时间。请使用 HH:MM、9am、noon 或 YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM。",
    "I don't know where “{place}” is. Try a big city nearby, a country with one time zone, or an IANA zone like Europe/Paris.": "不知道“{place}”在哪里。试试附近的大城市、只有一个时区的国家，或像 Europe/Paris 这样的 IANA 时区。",
    "It is {time}, {difference}.": "现在是 {time}，{difference}。",
    "It is {time}.": "现在是 {time}。",
    "the same time as you": "与你这里时间相同",
    "{date} at {offset} ({zone})": "{offset} 的 {date}（{zone}）",
    "{date} here ({zone})": "这里是 {date}（{zone}）",
    "{date} here in {place} ({zone})": "这里（{place}）是 {date}（{zone}）",
    "{date} in UTC ({zone})": "UTC 时间 {date}（{zone}）",
    "{date} in {place} ({zone})": "{place} 是 {date}（{zone}）",
    "{offset} isn't a real UTC offset.": "{offset} 不是有效的 UTC 偏移。",
    "{span} ahead of you": "比你那里快 {span}",
    "{span} behind you": "比你那里慢 {span}",
    "{time} doesn't happen on that day: the clocks skip that hour. Try an hour later.": "那天没有 {time}：时钟会跳过这一小时。请试试晚一小时。",
    "{time} is:": "{time} 对应：",
    "“{time}” isn't a real date.": "“{time}”不是有效日期。",
    "“{time}” isn't a time of day.": "“{time}”不是一天中的时间。",
